      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Internal corporate ads</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Motivational messages, product presentations for sales teams, recordings for trade shows and industry events. We often pair these with audio-video editing so you receive a finished asset ready to embed in a multimedia presentation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
