<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="py-16 bg-stone-100/60 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 text-center">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 text-center mb-10">Answers to the questions that come up most often when commissioning an advertising spot.</p>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>How much does a voiceover for an ad cost?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Pricing depends mainly on the usage scope (broadcast medium). A local radio spot starts from 300 PLN net, national from approx. 1,000 PLN. Local TV from 600 PLN, national TV from 2,200 PLN. Full pricing in the table above.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Is a radio voice different from a TV voice?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Often the same talent works in both media, but the dynamics differ - radio rewards stronger storytelling, TV calls for synergy with the picture. We'll help match the voice to your specific production.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>What licence applies to an advertising recording?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">12 months from the broadcast date as standard. After that you can renew the licence or commission a fresh recording.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Can I get a same-day express recording?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Yes - orders placed by 14:00 are delivered by 18:00 the same business day. +50% surcharge on the base rate. Details on <a href="/en/express-recording/" class="text-accent hover:underline">express recording</a>.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Do you record spots in foreign languages?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Yes. Native voice rates are typically about 2× higher than Polish voices. We work with talent in 30+ languages - see <a href="/en/voice-bank/?native=1" class="text-accent hover:underline">native voice artists</a>.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Do you also produce sponsor billboards and in-store spots?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Yes - these are frequent assignments. Pricing scales with the broadcast reach. We also handle in-store audio for retail chains nationwide.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Can I attend the recording session remotely?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Yes - we offer <a href="/en/remote-sessions/" class="text-accent hover:underline">real-time remote direction</a>. You can suggest changes during the session itself.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>How do I pick the right voice for my ad?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Filter our <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:underline">voice bank</a> by gender, age, language and tone. We recommend listening to 3-5 samples and comparing against the character of your product. If in doubt, <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-accent hover:underline">contact us</a> and we'll help you choose.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

